  "timeline": [
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 1,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_32919559cd3248f388b2495bcc21ca64",
        "scene_id": "scn_24d79e9993cd4d429612e411d7ce8c93",
        "seq": 1,
        "actor_id": "agt_23787d5d80b248e49b699f2174fec8ff",
        "text": "一瓶水，谢谢。",
        "reply_to_message_id": null,
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:39.956524Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "周远"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 2,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_033b0ffb2fde44a785ecb774efbc025c",
        "scene_id": "scn_24d79e9993cd4d429612e411d7ce8c93",
        "seq": 2,
        "actor_id": "agt_6d89b564d4264557ade90c4ee4adad1a",
        "text": "哎，这雨说下就下了，一点预兆都没有。你也是来避雨的吗？我就住附近，刚搬来没多久，晚上一个人待着没事干就爱往这儿跑。",
        "reply_to_message_id": null,
        "requested_speaker_id": "agt_23787d5d80b248e49b699f2174fec8ff",
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:42.023666Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "郑好"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 3,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_728fcecfa78a48869cb7a8e09cc4dfd0",
        "scene_id": "scn_24d79e9993cd4d429612e411d7ce8c93",
        "seq": 3,
        "actor_id": "agt_23787d5d80b248e49b699f2174fec8ff",
        "text": "嗯，避雨。等车。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_033b0ffb2fde44a785ecb774efbc025c",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:43.126006Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "周远"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 4,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_d80479bbb61145d1bb926b46f5a0cb5e",
        "scene_id": "scn_24d79e9993cd4d429612e411d7ce8c93",
        "seq": 4,
        "actor_id": "agt_b879b55aa8324030a02e31d19c83c7e4",
        "text": "水，六块。雨一时半会儿停不了。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_32919559cd3248f388b2495bcc21ca64",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:43.960903Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "林小满"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 5,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_17049cd5cc1d4f408adfd70e55b0a958",
        "scene_id": "scn_24d79e9993cd4d429612e411d7ce8c93",
        "seq": 5,
        "actor_id": "agt_6d89b564d4264557ade90c4ee4adad1a",
        "text": "六块啊，那跟外面那家一个价。你们这儿夜里人都这么多吗？我搬来快两周了，头一回碰上下雨，还挺新鲜的。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_d80479bbb61145d1bb926b46f5a0cb5e",
        "requested_speaker_id": "agt_b879b55aa8324030a02e31d19c83c7e4",
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:45.014669Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "郑好"
    },
    {
      "kind": "event",
      "seq": 6,
      "message": null,
      "event": {
        "body": "店外雨势变大，广播说附近末班公交还有五分钟到站。大家可以自行决定接下来做什么。",
        "visibility": "ALL",
        "target_agent_id": null,
        "event_id": "evt_06521b1468ca4666bcea9bee29c43915",
        "scene_id": "scn_24d79e9993cd4d429612e411d7ce8c93",
        "seq": 6,
        "status": "EFFECTIVE",
