      "author_name": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 7,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_e4fed3bf9bbf4f75807ab2125d2de578",
        "scene_id": "scn_24d79e9993cd4d429612e411d7ce8c93",
        "seq": 7,
        "actor_id": "agt_b879b55aa8324030a02e31d19c83c7e4",
        "text": "末班车还有五分钟。要买什么赶紧。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_17049cd5cc1d4f408adfd70e55b0a958",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:46.408186Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "林小满"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 8,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_f5f1107ee2ea4694b1474b67344e0615",
        "scene_id": "scn_24d79e9993cd4d429612e411d7ce8c93",
        "seq": 8,
        "actor_id": "agt_23787d5d80b248e49b699f2174fec8ff",
        "text": "谢谢。车快到了，我去站台了。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_e4fed3bf9bbf4f75807ab2125d2de578",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:47.471276Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "周远"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 9,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_cbe7ef27905c4a42b30a5515e462b2bb",
        "scene_id": "scn_24d79e9993cd4d429612e411d7ce8c93",
        "seq": 9,
        "actor_id": "agt_6d89b564d4264557ade90c4ee4adad1a",
        "text": "哎，车这么快就来啦？那你赶紧去吧，别淋着。我也再待会儿，反正回去也没事干。对了，你等的是几路车啊？",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_f5f1107ee2ea4694b1474b67344e0615",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:48.337840Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "郑好"
    },
    {
      "kind": "event",
      "seq": 10,
      "message": null,
      "event": {
        "body": "只有你收到公交提醒：末班车临时提前两分钟，其他人暂时不知道。",
        "visibility": "TARGETED",
