        "seq": 11,
        "actor_id": "agt_23787d5d80b248e49b699f2174fec8ff",
        "text": "七路。谢了，我先走了。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_cbe7ef27905c4a42b30a5515e462b2bb",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:50.288075Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "周远"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 12,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_ae72e438b5e64746b2fa7b36b4b4b22e",
        "scene_id": "scn_24d79e9993cd4d429612e411d7ce8c93",
        "seq": 12,
        "actor_id": "agt_6d89b564d4264557ade90c4ee4adad1a",
        "text": "七路啊，那你路上小心点！哎，这雨越下越大了，也不知道我待会儿怎么回去。老板，你们这儿有伞卖吗？",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_e3a21716e02741ac8824a17f375ce9d7",
        "requested_speaker_id": "agt_b879b55aa8324030a02e31d19c83c7e4",
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:19:51.220037Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "郑好"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 13,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_8348e20182b54da9a8fe8e2e1031a6cb",
        "scene_id": "scn_24d79e9993cd4d429612e411d7ce8c93",
        "seq": 13,
        "actor_id": "agt_b879b55aa8324030a02e31d19c83c7e4",
        "text": "伞有，十五一把。最后一排货架。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_ae72e438b5e64746b2fa7b36b4b4b22e",
